@startuml
title Lifecycle of a DiagnosticReport

left to right direction

'!theme plain

' --- Define the States of the DiagnosticReport ---
state Registered : Photographer has stored the form.
state Partial : Ready for AI grading.
state Preliminary : Graded, but no final conclusion yet.
state Final : Grading complete, report finalized.

' --- Define the Transitions (The Workflow) ---

[*] -> Registered
Registered --> Partial : Sectra study ID\nreceived
Partial --> Preliminary : Inconclusive grading
Preliminary -left-> Preliminary : Inconclusive grading
Preliminary --> Final : Conclusive grading
Partial -down-> Final : Conclusive grading
Final -> [*]

' A final report can be amended later.
'Final --> Final : AI grading added belatedly

@enduml
